<BaseLayout title="Work — Eric Angella" description="Content Strategy Services">
  <p class="section-label" style="padding-top: 60px;">Work with me</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Let's work together.</h1>

<p>Most content strategies are built for a market that no longer exists. I help B2B tech teams build ones that keep up.</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Start with strategy.</strong> In 60 to 90 days, we define who needs to hear from you, what your service solves for them, and where to publish. You leave with a 90-day plan of specific, ordered steps you can run in-house or hand to someone else. <strong>$4,500.</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Then build the system.</strong> A research system that tracks what your market is talking about, plus an editorial guideline, voice context, social calendar, and draft generator, so your content starts from real signals and stays human. <strong>$5,500.</strong></li>
  <li><strong>Not sure where you stand?</strong> The Exposure Audit reviews your wider content footprint and shows what's possible. <strong>From $750</strong>, and the fee credits toward a strategy engagement if you book within 30 days.</li>
</ul>

<p>Every layer can be bought on its own.</p>

<p><a href="https://calendly.com/eric-angella/30min">Book a conversation &rarr;</a></p>

<p>Not ready to talk? <a href="https://substack.com/@ericangella">Read the Content Market Report &rarr;</a> A weekly look at which content strategies are worth investing in right now.</p>


